                    `prod(\ `:attr:`A`\ `.shape[:\ `:attr:`ind`\ `]) ==
                    prod(\ `:attr:`A`\ `.shape[\ `:attr:`ind`\ `:])`.
    ind (int): index at which to compute the inverse of :func:`torch.tensordot`. Default: `2`.

Keyword args:
    out (Tensor, optional): output tensor. Ignored if `None`. Default: `None`.

Raises:
